WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:03.770
- So y'all, do you all have
any over drinking stories?

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:04.850
Maybe for daytime.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:05.683
- For daytime?

00:00:05.683 --> 00:00:07.080
- For daytime TV?

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.388
- Yeah.

00:00:08.388 --> 00:00:09.221
- You know us.

00:00:09.221 --> 00:00:10.757
- That narrows it down.

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:14.534
- I heard that your most drunk moments are

00:00:14.534 --> 00:00:15.822
with Blake Shelton.

00:00:15.822 --> 00:00:16.670
- Yes, somehow,

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:19.329
- Cause I'm gonna be honest with you,

00:00:19.329 --> 00:00:22.330
I think it was your story
that I have an identical story

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:25.010
with my bed and my
husband holding my hair.

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:26.835
Cause Blake is the enemy
when you are drinking.

00:00:26.835 --> 00:00:28.452
(audience laughing)

00:00:28.452 --> 00:00:30.120
I had just started drinking
cause I'd had a baby

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.110
and it literally.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.670
- This probably was
her first over drinking

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:37.010
- I had never really gotten
sick from drinking and so

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.210
- [Kelly] Boy, it's fun.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.030
- And it was Blake's fault

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:42.850
- Blake kept handing her

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:43.760
- He kept handing me things

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:45.820
- Like Irish car bombs and I'm like, Dude.

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:47.597
This is not going to go well.

00:00:47.597 --> 00:00:49.980
- So I
- Ronnie Dunn does that too.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.430
- That's right there.

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:54.120
So I got to the bus and I was like

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.220
I've never felt that feeling
of spinning or you know.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:01:00.720
And I got in my bunk and
laid down and Jimmy goes

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.359
you should put one foot
out of your bunk and try

00:01:03.359 --> 00:01:04.880
- [Jimmy] Ground yourself

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:07.380
- Try to settle yourself and
then Kimberly, she's so sweet.

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:08.760
She opened my curtain, she goes

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.603
You want a peanut butter sandwich?

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:12.400
(audience laughing)

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.130
Then I said, yeah I do.

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:15.190
I don't feel very good.

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:17.550
And then I woke up the next morning

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.190
and the peanut butter sandwich
is laying next to her.

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:21.400
- It didn't quite get there.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:22.610
- So thanks Blake.

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:23.627
Sorry mom and dad.

00:01:23.627 --> 00:01:24.610
- Yeah, its a revelation.

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:27.020
- I blame Blake and Ronnie Dunn.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.507
I'm like wow,

00:01:28.507 --> 00:01:31.417
my worst alcoholic experiences
involve those two men.

